Description: Raw data objects to be used for blood cell proportion
        estimation in minfi and similar packages. 
        The FlowSorted.Blood.EPIC object is based in samples assayed
        by Brock Christensen and colleagues; for details see Salas et al. 2018.
        https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/query/acc.cgi?acc=GSE110554.
License: GPL-3
